WEBVTT

00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:01.302
was realizing that the aspects
of my personality

00:03:01.344 --> 00:03:05.389
that I was most ashamed of
and had really tried to hide

00:03:05.431 --> 00:03:07.433
were in fact on full display
for everybody.

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:12.188
And those included my two most prominent
and problematic demons:

00:03:12.188 --> 00:03:13.648
anger and self-centeredness.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:15.816
(Clears throat)

00:03:15.816 --> 00:03:18.277
Sorry. I've never talked
about this publicly before.

00:03:20.905 --> 00:03:21.948
(Applause)

00:03:21.948 --> 00:03:23.199
Thank you.

00:03:26.911 --> 00:03:30.164
I thought we weren't supposed
to applaud authoritarians here at TED.